# Large data / model outputs: ignore bulky subfolders in any outputs/ dir
# (use **/ to anchor at any depth), and any common heavy file formats.
# Writeups (*.md, *.tex, *.pdf, *.txt) inside outputs/ are kept — they are
# the only files explicitly added to git from outputs/.
**/outputs/experiments/
**/outputs/data/
**/outputs/temp/
**/outputs/tokenizer/
**/outputs/eval_results/
**/outputs/checkpoints/
**/outputs/output/
**/outputs/*.json
**/outputs/*.npz
**/outputs/*.pt
**/outputs/*.bin
**/outputs/baseline/
**/outputs/pilot/
wandb/
math_qwen_memory/sbatch/logs
# Model weights at any path
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pth
*.h5
*.hdf5

